\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Ginandjar says no CB  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 420 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Mai 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, May 1 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's top economics minister Ginandjar Kartasasmita said on Friday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and would allow the rupiah to float freely. \par \par \uc2  "(\b \highlight22\uc2 Central) Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Indonesia will not risk its international reserves speculating in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," he told Reuters in an interview. \par \par \uc2  "Accordingly, it will not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, allowing the rupiah to float freely," he said. \par \par \uc2  Ginandjar, coordinating minister for economics and finance, also said an impartial \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was essential to the country's reforms. \par \par \uc2  "One of the key elements of Indonesia's economic programme is to have an independent \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  that can restore the stability of the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  "The policies adopted to achieve the stability of the rupiah are fairly straightforward and simple and have been incorporated into the programme supported by the International Monetary Fund," he said. \par \par \uc2  The IMF's executive board is due to meet in Washington on Monday to review Indonesia's progress in economic reforms as well as to release $1.0 billion from the next $3.0 billion balance of payments loan, with the rest to be disbursed over the following two months. \par \par \uc2  Ginandjar, the guiding minister in the reform programme, also said Bank Indonesia would not create new rupiahs in net terms through its domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "This policy implies that its net domestic credit expansion will be zero, maintaining the net domestic assets of its balance sheet at their end-March level," he said. \par \par \uc2  "Under this policy, any growth in liquidity credits will be offset by a corresponding increase in Bank Indonesia's open market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," the minister added. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  operates in the money market by issuing \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  certificates (SBIs) to drain excess liquidity, and buys short-term securities (SBPUs) to inject liquidity. \par \par \uc2  Ginandjar said the latest report from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  showed it had successfully implemented its policies since the beginning of April. \par \par \uc2  "The net international reserves of Bank Indonesia have increased by $1.1 billion since the end of March, thanks in part to the support from Bank Indonesia's foreign commercial bank correspondents. \par \par \uc2  "At the same time, its net domestic assets are below the end-March level, meaning that Bank Indonesia has had a contractionary stance in net terms. \par \par \uc2  "Continued action along these policies will restore the stability of the rupiah quickly," the minister said. \par \par \uc2  - Jakarta newsroom (6221) 384-6364; Fax (6221) 344-8404 \par \par \uc2  - Email: jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du510632b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
