\par\par \b \uc2  Exotic  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2 /Rupiah -3: Dlr Fix Talk Opens Fresh Flows \b0\par\par\uc2 344 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 1998\par 21:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  On the one hand, the IMF's apparent return to favor in Jakarta suggests its package of key reforms may yet go through. This is ultimately supportive of the rupiah over the long term and therefore may explain its recent stability, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  An alternative view is that some traders may simply be hanging onto positions in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the hope of tidy profits if the fixed rate is indeed introduced. The argument follows that if those punters get a definitive 'no', they will dump the rupiah and send it sharply lower. \par \par \uc2  MFR's Koss describes three scenarios: 'You will have IDR15,000 in the short term if you don't have a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board and you don't have an IMF plan and IDR5,000 if you just get a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board - for a week, or as long as it would last. If you end up with an IMF package and no \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board, it might just hang in at these levels.' \par \par \uc2  Ironically, the frantic buying interest unleashed by the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board issue may also have contributed to the rupiah's more stable performance of late. \par \par \uc2  'People were introduced to two-way markets again,' said Keith Woodfin, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Analytics in Essex, Connecticut. 'People found some actual demand for the rupiah and that has given them a sense of caution' over holding short-rupiah positions. \par \par \uc2  Indeed, traders note that much of the rupiah's excessive volatility in January was due to a virtual drought of demand. Thin volumes produced precipitous downward slides and at the same time made it easier for Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , to engineer rebounds through \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  But the signals coming out of \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  remain extremely discouraging, analysts say, and the possibility of massive flight from the rupiah remains high. \par \par \uc2  One crucial concern is the growing number of riots over rising prices across the country and the doubts over the security forces' ability to peacefully contain them. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 26-02-98 \par \par \uc2  2025GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du2q01r9a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
