\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia's Rupiah Ends Lower On G-7's Lack Of Action \b0\par\par\uc2 237 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Februar 1998\par 11:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah (IDR) closed lower against the U.S. dollar Monday in thin dealings in sympathy with other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which were let down by the lack of action taken by the Group of Seven leading industrialized nations to help the region, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah closed at IDR9,650 for each dollar in the spot market for Asian trading, down slightly from its close Friday at IDR9,100. \par \par \uc2  'The market was disappointed with the G-7, which did not offer a concrete solution to help Southeast Asian economies,' said a dealer with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers added that the uncertainty over the implementation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board in Indonesia confused the market and pushed most participants to the sidelines. \par \par \uc2  Minister of Finance Mar'ie Muhammad couldn't provide a definite answer Monday on whether the government will implement the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board system. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah is seen testing IDR10,000 Tuesday as the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , is not expected to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would deplete the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, which are needed to back up the rupiah's fixed exchange rate under the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board system should it be implemented. \par \par \uc2  -By I Mad