\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Rupiah Higher Late On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 , Good Sentiment \b0\par\par\uc2 207 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Februar 1998\par 10:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's rupiah (IDR) closed higher against\par the U.S. dollar in trading late Wednesday due to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by Bank\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the nation's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , and growing confidence in the\par battered local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , dealers said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Despite this optimism, however, dealers say they still expect pressure\par on the rupiah from concerns over social unrest and political stability.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  'Despite these gains, I stick think there's a lot of dollar bullishness in the market,' a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  According to traders in Singapore, the U.S. unit is being bought at IDR9,500 in the spot market at 0926 GMT (4:26 a.m. EST) Wednesday, after starting the day at IDR10,260. \par \par \uc2  Many Jakarta dealers, however, are quoting even stronger rates for the rupiah of IDR8,500 against the dollar in late Asian trading. \par \par \uc2  An improvement in sentiment has been tied to recent moves by the government to organize talks to handle the nation's $140 billion in dollar borrowings and also moves to stabilize the nation's banking sector. \par \par \uc2  Analysts caution, however, that social and political concerns could override purely economic concerns in the weeks ahead. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 04-02-98 \par \par \uc2  0944GMT \par 