\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  will help rupiah near-term - analysts. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Phil Smith \par \uc2 515 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Januar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, Jan 22 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is the right step for \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to take and will help halt the rupiah's slide, but only in the near-term, analysts said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has certainly come at the eleventh hour, given the rupiah's 60 percent slide since the turn of the year, but will help arrest the meltdown because volume in dollar/rupiah is so tiny at the moment. \par \par \uc2  "It's not a long-term answer, but with spreads as wide as we are seeing in dollar/rupiah, it won't take much to move it by 600 or 1,000," said Chiang Yao Chye, head of Asia Pacific Research at CIBC in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  Spreads in dollar/rupiah have been as wide as 1,000 rupiah when trading has become highly erratic. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday there were bids from brokers for rupiah at levels of 16,500 and 17,000 to the U.S. dollar, but it was unclear now much business was being done at these levels, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah opened around 11,000 but quickly started to fall, and Singapore traders reported dollars going through at 15,000 in early business. \par \par \uc2  It was then Bank Indonesia entered the market, selling dollars at 13,500 rupiah, then again at 14,000. \par \par \uc2  Late in the day the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would step up \b \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  if need be and would soon draw on an existing $2.0 billion stand-by loan facility and partly use it to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The government of Indonesia will do its utmost to stabilise the rupiah's value against the dollar," a senior government official said. \par \par \uc2  After that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was in again at 12,000 in late trading. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said with spreads so wide and trading volume so thin, any \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  buying of dollars would have a significant impact. \par \par \uc2  "Immediately the offer (on dollar/rupiah) gets hit, it jumps up by the spread," said one trader. "So with very little, they will be able to move it in 1,000 roop (rupiah) jumps. And that will continue to work as long as volume remains as tiny as it is." \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is certainly not the complete answer for \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but something has to be done to stop the rot in the rupiah and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a way of buying time, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  "It won't provide long-term stability but they have to buy time given the extent of the rupiah's fall," CIBC's Yao Chye said. \par \par \uc2  "Long-term solutions have to be addressed and would have to include a debt restructuring programme." \par \par \uc2  Indonesia has around $140 billion total external debt, of which around $66 billion is in the hands of the private sector. \par \par \uc2  Dealers noted there had been talk in the market of dollar/rupiah going to 20,000 by the end of the week, but that looked highly unlikely if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept up its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Desk +65-870-3840 \par \par \uc2  asia.\b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2 @reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du1m02g6o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
