\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Up Vs Dollar In Extremely Thin Market \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Dezember 1997\par 04:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah opened slightly higher versus the U.S. dollar in thin trading Monday as market participants expect another round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  On Friday, Bank Indonesia sold the dollar on at least two occasions and drove the rupiah up as much as 18% against the dollar before it closed Friday at 5,300. \par \par \uc2  Traders say they expect the dollar to trade Monday in a range between 5,400 on the high-end and 4,500 on the low-end. The U.S. unit is being bought at 5,200 rupiah in the spot market at 0252 GMT Monday, after closing Friday at 5,300 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Dealers note that corporate demand for the rupiah remains strong, which can be seen in the exorbitant rates being charged in the swap market. The overnight dollar/rupiah is currently a negative 100, while the tomorrow/next day swap rate is at a negative 25, or 72%. \par \par \uc2  Experiencing success Friday in its market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, dealers are convinced Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will come into the market in the afternoon session to drive up the rupiah. The year-end is seen as an important time to support the rupiah due to corporate accounting and debt-servicing obligations. \par \par \uc2  'It seems clear that Bank Indonesia will make use of the light market conditions and support the rupiah,' said Pardi Kendy, a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at PT Mitsubishi Bank Buana in Jakarta. 