\par\par \b \uc2  REPEAT:SE Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Mixed;Mkt Eyes 6,000 Rupiah,S$1.70 \b0\par\par\uc2  By Joseph Rajendran \par \uc2 296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Dezember 1997\par 11:56\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--Southeast Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  are\par mixed late Monday compared with late Friday as mild\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the domestic\par market and bargain hunting for the U.S. dollar against the\par Singapore dollar grab the spotlight, said dealers.\par    Although trading volumes continued to dwindle with\par market players ready to close their books for the year-end,\par sentiment in the U.S. dollar against the Southeast Asian\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  remained upbeat, said dealers.\par    Against the Indonesian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Monday, the dollar\par traded to an intraday high of 5,400 rupiah before falling on\par attempts by the Indonesian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to sell the U.S.\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , said market sources. But they added that the\par upside objective of 6,000 rupiah to the U.S. dollar still\par remains intact.\par    "The movements were exaggerated because the market is\par very illiquid now," said the regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  head at a\par French bank here.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  "But people are quite happy to pick (the\par dollar at) bottoms," he said, referring to the 5,000 rupiah\par level against the U.S. dollar as a good entry point.\par    At 1000 GMT (5:00 a.m. EST), the dollar is at 5,000\par rupiah, well below 5,950 rupiah seen in late Friday trading,\par and 5,900 rupiah in late Wednesday trading.\par    A fall in the U.S. dollar against the Singapore dollar,\par one of the largest movements in Southeast Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par Monday, prompted market players to buy U.S. dollars against\par the regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , said a regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dealer\par at a major German bank. The dollar should trade higher to\par S$1.70 in the near term, he added.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  12-29-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0556EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dtct02rr5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
