\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Gov -3:  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  To Continue  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 237 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Dezember 1997\par 05:16\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's overextended banking sector is seen as the one of the main causes of the nation's financial crisis, which has caused the rupiah to lose nearly 60% since the beginning of the year. \par \par \uc2  He referred to the liquidation of 16 banks in November, as part of the program to consolidate and strengthen the sector, but he said the short-term result wasn't as expected, having sent 'shock waves across the economy.' \par \par \uc2  'The banking system is in distress beyond expectations,' he said, as the process caused a contagion effect, leading some borrowers to move their deposits offshore. \par \par \uc2  Conceding that Indonesia's banking supervision should be more disciplined, he said that competition led some banks to engage in high-risk aggressive financing in sectors sensitive to economic shifts such as property. \par \par \uc2  And while the policies so far may seem 'eclectic,' Soedradjad said the overall thrust of the policy is to make the economy more responsive to market signals, and to strike a balance between supporting the rupiah and preventing 'undue distress on the banking sector.' \par \par \uc2  Although he did not specifically address the recent rapid depreciation of the rupiah, he did say that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to discourage speculation in short-term transactions, but that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will eventually stop once the unit stabilizes. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 18-12-97 \par \par \uc2  0416GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtci09rtn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
