\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Ends A Touch Higher As Regionals Rebound \b0\par\par\uc2 271 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Dezember 1997\par 11:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah ended slightly higher against the U.S. dollar in volatile trading Wednesday as other Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  rebounded against the dollar, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 5,550 rupiah in the Jakarta trading session, down from its close Tuesday at 5,560 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Dealers added that the yen's strong rebound to 126.66 for each dollar at 0933 GMT (4:33 a.m. EST) from 130.76 Tuesday gave a boost to the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was not heard \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market Wednesday. But dealers suspected that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  indirectly in the afternoon session through the state-owned PT Bank Dagang Negara. \par \par \uc2  Pardy Kendy, PT Bank Buana Indonesia's head of treasury department, said that the dollar met resistance as local exporters sold their dollars on rises. \par \par \uc2  'Local exporters has been selling their dollars since Tuesday as they see that the dollar has risen to unrealistic levels,' Kendy said. \par \par \uc2  Market participants added that the market will closely watch President Suharto's public appearance on Thursday, his first after a 15-day rest. The 76-year-old President is scheduled to officiate the graduation ceremony for military cadets. Rumors about the health of Asia's longest-serving leader last week sent the rupiah down by 22%. \par \par \uc2  The official news agency, Antara, reported Wednesday that parts of the ceremony will be cut to shorten the length of the ceremony. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 350 0145 \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-12-97 \par \par \uc2  1020GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtch09p2l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
