\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia: Officials Investigate Cause Of Office Block Fire \b0\par\par\uc2 307 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Dezember 1997\par 07:23\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Firefighters were investigating whether sparks from a welding torch started a massive blaze in a newly built high-rise office block in which 15 people died, newspapers reported Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Earlier speculation had that Monday's blaze, which gutted the three top floors of the Bank Indonesia tower on Jakarta's main street, might have been caused by an electrical fault. \par \par \uc2  However, the newspaper Kompas quoted Jakarta fire chief Suharso as saying this was unlikely because mains power had not been connected to the affected floors. \par \par \uc2  'Maybe the fire was caused by another factor, such as people welding,' Suharso reportedly said. \par \par \uc2  He was not immediately available for further comment Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Nine of the 15 dead perished after they were trapped in a smoke-filled elevator. \par \par \uc2  The newspaper Republika reported that four badly burned bodies had not been identified. \par \par \uc2  Five survivors were hospitalized with burns and smoke inhalation. \par \par \uc2  The damaged building was one of two brand new 25-story towers where workmen had been carrying out finishing touches to several executive suites and meeting rooms. \par \par \uc2  About 200 people who had been working in offices on lower floors were evacuated. Four workmen escaped the flames and were lifted to safety by a helicopter. \par \par \uc2  Another helicopter repeatedly emptied a large water bucket on the fire that burned for more than five hours. \par \par \uc2  The fire was another crisis for Bank Indonesia, the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is trying to prop up \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ailing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Despite the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and a $40 billion rescue plan, led by the International Monetary Fund, the value of the rupiah has slid dramatically over many weeks. \par \par \uc2  After morning trading Tuesday, the rupiah dived to around 4,575 rupiah to the U.S. dollar. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-12-97 \par \par \uc2  0623GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtc909g2y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
