\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah recovers after  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 571 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Dezember 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Dec 8 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah recovered from a historic low of 4,090 against the dollar in Jakarta and 4,085 in Singapore following \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  came in at the 4,070 level and helped calm a market hit by early regional weakness and by news that President Suharto had been advised to take 10 days rest. \par \par \uc2  They said the limited \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  provided some support for the rupiah. However, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  failed to mirror a recovery in the ringgit, which bounced ahead of Malaysian Finance Minister Anwar Ibrahim's speech in parliament. \par \par \uc2  Spot rupiah was at 4,065/75 at 0330 GMT, compared with an opening of 4,010/30. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market was weighed down mainly by Friday's news that Suharto was hit by fatigue and had cancelled a trip to Iran. \par \par \uc2  But the news hit a market already long on dollar positions, helping limit the rupiah decline, they said. \par \par \uc2  One foreign bank dealer said Suharto's health factor seemed to have also prevented the rupiah from recovering along with the ringgit. Instead, the rupiah absorbed weaknesses in the won and the baht. \par \par \uc2  State Secretary Murdiono announced last Friday that Suharto had cancelled a planned trip to Iran after being advised to take 10 days rest because of fatigue. \par \par \uc2  He said Suharto's doctors had opined that the president's health was good. Suharto returned to Jakarta last week from a strenuous 12-day trip that took him to Namibia, South Africa, Canada and Saudi Arabia. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah fell to a historic low of 4,090 in the morning on selling by both off- and onshore operators before profit-taking emerged and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  provided some stability in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The rupiah also withstood pressure in New York on Friday as the thin market there had established long positions on dollars. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the rupiah remained vulnerable and the underlying tone was still weak. However, one Singapore-based dealer said the rupiah was likely to creep higher to the 4,000 level because a further recovery in ringgit later in the day would trigger more profit-taking in dollars against the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Short-end swaps remained flush with ample offshore cash-flows, driving them further down into negative territory and forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to absorb overnight liquidity. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Bank Indonesia was seen bidding for overnight money at around 17 percent in the morning. They said offshore swap selling also pushed domestic rates down. \par \par \uc2  But they could not explain the persistent rich supplies of rupiah in Singapore market which aided long dollar holdings. \par \par \uc2  One U.S. bank dealer said cheap short-front swaps had also triggered some selling at the longer-end, up to six months. \par \par \uc2  In Jakarta, overnight swap was at -0.4/-0.2, tom/next at -0.5/-0.4, one-week at 3.5/4.5, one-month at 28/33, two at 60/65, three at 80/90, six at 185/190 and one-year at 370/400. \par \par \uc2  In Singapore, spot/next was at -0.6/-0.4, one-week at 1/5, one-month at 30/35, two at 75/85, three at 115/130, six at 230/245 and one-year at 475/500 points. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom (6221) 384-6364; Fax (6221) 344-8404 \par \par \uc2  -- E-mail: jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtc801gc2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
