\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-Indonesian markets dive to record lows. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Mantik Kusjanto \par \uc2 561 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Dezember 1997\par 11:59\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Dec 3 (Reuters) - Indonesia's rupiah plunged to a historic low on Wednesday and the stock market closed at its lowest level in more than four years. \par \par \uc2  The markets also ignored comments from U.S. Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan that the world economy would emerge stronger once Asia's financial problems have been resolved. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah plunged to a record low of 3,985 against the dollar before settling at 3,955/65 at the close in Jakarta. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has fallen slowly but steadily since July, with a brief respite in early November after the International Monetary Fund (IMF) set up a reform-cum-aid package for the country. \par \par \uc2  Under the package, Indonesia cut back on several big-ticket infrastructure projects and closed down 16 well-connected banks. \par \par \uc2  But the continued slide of the rupiah and the stock market, along with other regional markets, suggested confidence had not returned, raising calls for a repeat of October's concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets by the monetary authorities of \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Singapore and Japan. \par \par \uc2  However, Finance Minister Mar'ie Muhammad said in Malaysia on Tuesday that concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been put on hold because the entire region was in a slump. \par \par \uc2  The Jakarta composite index of 279 companies ended at a 51-month low of 389.68 points, down 1.17 percent on the day. But analysts said the bottom was not in sight although the market was cheap now. \par \par \uc2  They said expectations of poor corporate earnings until next year continued to contribute to the gloomy outlook for the market, with the upcoming presidential election next March also undermining sentiment. \par \par \uc2  "The rupiah is not unique. You got the baht at 43 and the ringgit at 3.66. These are all record lows. It's just amazing," said Vincent Low, fixed-income strategist with Merrill Lynch. \par \par \uc2  The market appeared to shrug off positive data which was announced during the day, including a healthy trade surplus of $1,246.6 million in September. \par \par \uc2  However, inflation data also announced on Wednesday was seen as somewhat worrisome, with consumer prices rising 1.65 percent in November, putting the year-on-year figure at 9.56 percent. \par \par \uc2  "This is a danger that Indonesia is facing now," Low said, adding stagflation might become a reality, with the economy slowing down while inflation was on the rise. \par \par \uc2  But he said a weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  always led to higher inflation in an open economy, adding that the El Nino weather phenomenon, which has led to a crippling drought in Indonesia, had also contributed to the woes. \par \par \uc2  President Suharto also warned of the dangers of the prolonged economic crisis and said the Indonesian people needed to be united at such a critical juncture. \par \par \uc2  "Let us take a lesson from this bitter ordeal to enable us to continue our national development process," Suharto was quoted by local newspapers as saying on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  "Let us boost our national efficiency...because only with such strength will we able to enter a more free and open world trade and economy," he said. \par \par \uc2  Suharto said the government would not hesitate to take all necessary measures to find the best way out of the financial upheaval. \par \par \uc2  Greenspan said a slowdown in Asian growth was inevitable, but that this could be temporary. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtc301ief\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
