\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia's Rupiah Lower Late, Nears 4,000 Rupiah Vs Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 304 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Dezember 1997\par 10:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah was trading lower against the U.S. dollar in scattered dealings late Wednesday, infected by the fresh attack on other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and on concerns about the weak South Korean won, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  After hitting a new all-time high of 3,980 rupiah, the dollar was trading at 3,935 rupiah in the spot market at 0858 GMT (3:58 a.m. EST), up from its close Tuesday at 3,810 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'Trading was thin on the rupiah and that explains the dollar's quick increase,' said a dealer with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said most participants are sidelined as the dollar is nearing 4,000 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'We want to sell the dollar at levels near 4,000 rupiah, but we are waiting for an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' a dealer with a foreign bank said. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not heard \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot market Wednesday. But, the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was believed to have bid for the rupiah in the one- and two-week swaps, dealers added. \par \par \uc2  As demand for the dollar is usually robust by the end of the year with multinational corporations expatriating dividends, the U.S. unit will remain well bid, dealers noted. And, if other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  continue falling to new lows, the rupiah is seen easily falling to 4,000 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'Only a concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  can save the rupiah from falling to the level (4,000 rupiah),' a dealer with a joint-venture bank said. \par \par \uc2  Liquidity of the rupiah was good late Wednesday. The overnight rupiah interbank offered rate slid to 14% from 16% earlier in the day. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana; (62-21) 350-0145 \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-12-97 \par \par \uc2  0910GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtc3098t9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
