\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah falls below 3,800, tone weak. \b0\par\par\uc2 379 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Dezember 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Dec 2 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah fell below the 3,800 level against the dollar in thin early trading on Tuesday, weighed down by persistent weakness in the region. \par \par \uc2  "The ringgit has hit another new low while the Singapore dollar is testing 1.61. It's difficult for the rupiah to buck the trend," one Singapore-based dealer said. \par \par \uc2  He said some U.S. investment funds were seen aggressively pushing the dollar up from the opening, driving the rupiah below the support level of 3,800. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah fell to a low of 3,815 before settling at around 3,795/3,810 at 0210 GMT, compared with an opening of 3,743/53. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen checking the market but had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  yet. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore-based dealer said there was no fresh reason for the continued weakness in the rupiah, and cited a contagion effect and domestic corporate demand for dollars. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia Director Paul Soetopo Tjokronegoro was quoted as saying that 40 percent of the estimated $9.6 billion rupiah in private debt due by March would be rolled over. \par \par \uc2  One \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst in Singapore had said the market could see a renewed concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from Japan, Singapore and \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the rupiah touched the 3,800 level. \par \par \uc2  One U.S. bank dealer said cheap swap rates in the short-end has also encouraged long dollar holdings. Overnight swap was at 0.1/0.2 and tom/next at -0.15/par points. \par \par \uc2  In Singapore, tom/next hit a low of -0.3 before edging to -0.1. Dealers said the thin market at year-end exaggerated falls in the rupiah, along with other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In Jakarta, one-week swap was at 1.5/3.5, one-month at 25/32, two at 45/60, three at 75/85, six at 160/175 and one-year at 360/400 points. \par \par \uc2  In Singapore, one-week was at 1/3, one-month at 30/35, two at 70/80, three at 110/130, six at 230/260 and one-year at 490/520 points. \par \par \uc2  -- Jakarta newsroom (6221) 384-6364; Fax (6221) 344-8404 \par \par \uc2  -- E-mail: jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtc201soc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
