\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Rupiah Lower Late Despite Central Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 233 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 November 1997\par 12:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rupiah ended sharply lower Monday due to continued local demand for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  However, the rupiah managed to strengthen slightly at the close from afternoon trading Monday on reported \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit is being bought at 3,615 rupiah in the spot market at 1043 GMT (5:43 a.m. EST) Monday, nearly 2% higher than its Friday close of 3,555 rupiah, but down from the 3,630 level reached at 0313 GMT (10:13 p.m. EST) earlier Monday. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia was seen selling dollars for rupiah at several levels in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets Monday afternoon, traders said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is said to have sold dollars at 3,620 rupiah and then at 3,610 rupiah in an effort to stem Monday's decline. \par \par \uc2  Dealers, however, expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to do little to support the rupiah as nearly $3 billion in U.S. dollar-denominated debt is set to come due every month in the next 12 months. With this in mind, dealers said that they expect the rupiah to again weaken and test the 3,700 level versus the dollar this week. \par \par \uc2  -By Jay Solomon; 62-21 386 1344 \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-11-97 \par \par \uc2  1102G