\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 's Rupiah Dn Early; Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Hasn't  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 233 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 November 1997\par 03:24\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rupiah lost further ground against the U.S. dollar in uneventful dealings early Thursday as most regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell against the dollar as well, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 3,542.50 rupiah in the spot market at 0216 GMT (9:16 p.m. EST), up from its close Wednesday at 3,515 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Dealers added that they have not yet heard Bank Indonesia in the market. But, the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the dollar rises excessively. \par \par \uc2  '\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will only help the rupiah temporarily as it still falls victim to contagion effect,' said a dealer with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  The financial woes affecting South Korea's won, along with increasing year-end demand for the dollar and the bearish sentiment on the Jakarta Stock Exchange are seen pushing the dollar upward to 3,570 rupiah Thursday. The strong support for the unit is seen at 3,500 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Liquidity of the rupiah was good early Thursday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  injected 1.291 trillion rupiah into the system. The overnight rupiah interbank offered rate fell to 14.50% early Thursday from 17% at its open, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  By I Made Sentana (62-21) 350-0145 \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-11-97 \par \par \uc2  0224GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtbk08uy0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
