\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Rupiah Dn Late Despite  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 November 1997\par 11:19\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rupiah was trading lower against the U.S. dollar in uneventful dealings late Wednesday despite several \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  launched by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , during the day, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was trading at 3,507.50 rupiah in the spot market at 0959 GMT, up from its close Tuesday at 3,455 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at levels above 3,500 rupiah failed to support the rupiah as the local unit fell in tandem with the woes inflicting Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The rupiah was also stressed out by Finance Minister Mar'ie Muhammad's statement to parliament members Wednesday that around 50% of the private sector's offshore debts of $65 billion will mature within 12 months, dealers added. \par \par \uc2  'It means that around $2.7 billion will be drained from the market each month and that is going to keep the dollar well bid,' said a dealer with a foreign bank. \par \par \uc2  Stock market dealers said that concerns over the private sector's foreign debt sent the Jakarta Stock Exchange (JSX) down by 4.9% to 412.827 points. \par \par \uc2  Dealers added that the repatriation of dividends by multi-national corporations by year-end intensifies demand for the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Dealers see the dollar trading between 3,450 rupiah and 3,550 rupiah Thursday. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 350-0145 \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-11-97 \par \par \uc2  1019GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtbj08udh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
