\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia's Rupiah Dn Early As Other Regional Units Fall \b0\par\par\uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 November 1997\par 03:39\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--Indonesia's rupiah weakened against the U.S. dollar in quiet dealings early Wednesday as offshore participants bought the dollar on its intact bullish tone against other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  After rising to an intraday high of 3,510 rupiah, the dollar was trading lower at 3,480 rupiah in spot market at 0209 GMT (9:09 p.m. EST). It had closed Tuesday at 3,455 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  'Offshore participants brought up the dollar up to test 3,500 rupiah,' said a dealer with a local bank. 'But, the dollar quickly fell to below 3,500 rupiah on fears of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not been heard selling the dollar early Wednesday. Some dealers, however, heard the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  checking the dollar-rupiah exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia injected 1.651 trillion rupiah into the system early Wednesday to keep liquidity good. Good liquidity sent the overnight rupiah interbank offered rate down to 15% from 20% at its open. \par \par \uc2  The overnight swap rate remained depressed at negative territory of -0.60 rupiah/-0.40 rupiah. The rate of the tomorrow/next day swap rose to 0.30 rupiah/0.45 rupiah from -0.50 rupiah/-0.40 rupiah late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  'The rise of the tomorrow/next day swap rate reflects that offshore participants are going long dollar in the spot market,' a dealer with a joint-venture bank said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers see the dollar trading between 3,450 rupiah and 3,550 rupiah Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 350-0145 \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-11-97 \par \par \uc2  0239GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtbj08srs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
