\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 's Rupiah Ends Slightly Up; Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 316 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 November 1997\par 11:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rupiah closed slightly higher against the U.S. dollar in Jakarta dealings Tuesday thanks to Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's active \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  After rising to an intraday high of 3,521 rupiah, the dollar closed at 3,465 rupiah in the spot market, down from its close Monday at 3,470 rupiah. \par \par \uc2  As reported earlier, Bank Indonesia was heard selling the dollar several times, both in the spot and swap markets, to help the rupiah. Dealers believe Bank Indonesia spent between $300 million and $500 million Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  'Many things looked unfavorable for the rupiah Tuesday,' said a dealer with a local bank. 'The won's plunge, ample liquidity in the rupiah, and increasing demand for the dollar at year end weighed on the rupiah.' \par \par \uc2  In order to tighten liquidity, Bank Indonesia was heard selling the dollar through the tomorrow/next day swap, dealers said. The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  pushed the tomorrow/next day swap rate to -0.10 rupiah/par before falling back to -0.50 rupiah/-0.20 rupiah, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The overnight rupiah interbank offered rate fell to 13% from 14% at its open. \par \par \uc2  Dealers added that local corporations are still keen to buy the dollar on dips. \par \par \uc2  'The weakness of the regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and hefty demand for the dollar by local companies will make Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  ineffective in curbing the dollar's rise,' said a dealer with a foreign bank in Jakarta. \par \par \uc2  Contrary to the market's belief on the purpose of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has noted that the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not aimed at containing the dollar at a certain limit, but to prevent the disorderly rise of the dollar. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 350-0145 \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 18-11-97 \par \par \uc2  1020GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtbi08sgl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
