\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Dn Early; Rupiah  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 November 1997\par 03:41\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--Southeast Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par fell against the U.S. dollar in thin early trading on Friday\par morning.\par    U.S. dollar buying from Indonesian corporations has\par pushed the rupiah well below the level around 34.10 rupiah\par at which Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to support the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par during Thursday's session.\par    At 0230 GMT (9:30 PM EST Thursday) the U.S. dollar is\par quoted at 3,445 rupiah, down from 3,400 rupiah late\par Thursday.\par    If the current rupiah weakening continues, say traders,\par Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is certain to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  again, possibly in\par conjunction with the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Singapore and the\par Bank of Japan, in a repeat of the previous week's action.\par    "The IMF said rupiah stability is essential to the\par implementation of its Indonesian package, so I think there\par will be more \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," said a trader at a Japanese bank\par in Singapore, who thought the central banks are likely to\par enter the market at levels around 3,500 rupiah to the U.S.\par dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    The Thai baht is also lower in the offshore market,\par after a U.S. financial institution based in Hong Kong was\par seen buying U.S. dollars. Many traders suspect that the\par institution is acting for the Bank of Thailand, which is\par believed to be arbitraging the differential between the\par offshore and onshore markets.\par    In the offshore market the dollar is currently quoted at\par 38.50 baht, up from 38.30 baht in late Asian trading\par Thursday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) DOW JONES NEWS  11-13-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2141EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 4340 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dtbe02g0k\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (indonesia near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbr